<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-BRAZIL TAKE DOUBLES AGAINST THE U.S..</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRAZIL TAKE DOUBLES AGAINST THE U.S..</headline>
<dateline>RIBEIRAO PRETO, Brazil 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States led Brazil 2-1 in their Davis Cup world group first round tie after Brazil, 2-0 down overnight, won the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Jaime Oncins/Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Alex O'Brien/Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-2 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
